# ---- PyInstaller / build output (regenerated by Build-EXE.bat) ----
build/
dist/
build_res/          # extracted Tcl/Tk data; recreated by extract_tcl.py
*.spec              # GAMGUI.spec is regenerated each build

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ---- Runtime / local ----
Logs/               # per-session logs written at runtime
gamgui.ini          # local machine's saved gam.exe path

# ---- Packaging / staging artifacts ----
GAMGUI-Distribution/
GAMGUI-Distribution.zip
_share_stage/
*.zip
